---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import skinbynesrinImg from "../assets/img/portfolio/skinbynesrin-performance.png";
import sealsArchiveImg from "../assets/img/portfolio/seals-archive.png";
import pinballImg from "../assets/img/portfolio/pinball.png";
import { IconOpenInNew } from "../components/Icons";
---

<Layout title="Frontend Developer - Ux Ui designer" noIndex={true}>
  <article>
    <div style="padding-top:128px; max-width:728px; margin:auto;">
      <h2>Burak Kuyucaklı, freelance ux-ui design and frontend development</h2>
      <h3>
        This is a curated selection of projects I’ve personally designed and
        developed:
      </h3>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <h3>
            <a href="https://skinbynesrin.com" target="_blank"
              >Skinbynesrin.com <IconOpenInNew fill="aqua" /></a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="small">Ocak 2025</p>
          <h4 class="small color-variant-01">Overview</h4>
          <p>
            I designed and developed the new SkinByNesrin website using <strong
              >modern</strong
            >,
            <strong>high-performance</strong> web technologies. The previous site
            was a slow, outdated WordPress setup with missing and outdated content.
            I rebuilt it from the ground up with a clean design, clear content structure,
            and significantly improved performance. The result is a fast-loading,
            mobile-friendly website that accurately reflects the brand’s professionalism
            and allows visitors to easily explore services and get in touch.
          </p>
          <a href="https://skinbynesrin.com" target="_blank"
            ><Image src={skinbynesrinImg} alt="skin by nesrin" /></a
          >
        </li>

        <li>
          <h3>
            <a href="https://muhur.yek.gov.tr/" target="_blank"
              >Muhur.yek.gov.tr <IconOpenInNew fill="aqua" /></a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="small">Aralık 2023</p>
          <h4 class="small color-variant-01">Overview</h4>
          <p>
            I developed the front-end of the Seal Database Website for the
            Presidency of the <strong>Turkish Manuscripts Institution</strong>.
            To increase visitor engagement and traffic, I also created a small
            interactive JavaScript game tailored to the site’s theme.
            Prioritizing performance and accessibility, I built the interface
            using Vanilla JavaScript without relying on heavy frameworks,
            ensuring a fast and lightweight experience.
          </p>
          <a href="https://muhur.yek.gov.tr/" target="_blank"
            ><Image
              src={sealsArchiveImg}
              alt="Presidency of the Turkish Manuscripts Institution"
            /></a
          >
        </li>

        <li>
          <h3>
            <a href="https://pinball.kuyucakli.com/" target="_blank"
              >Pinball.kuyucakli.com <IconOpenInNew fill="aqua" /></a
            >
          </h3>
          <p class="small">Şubat 2024</p>
          <h4 class="small color-variant-01">Overview</h4>
          <p>
            A minimal browser-based pinball game built with typescript, focused
            on smooth physics, responsive controls, and performance—designed as
            a
            <strong>lightweight, engaging web experience</strong>. Designed and
            developed by me.
          </p>
          <a href="https://pinball.kuyucakli.com/" target="_blank"
            ><Image src={pinballImg} alt="Pinball game" /></a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <aside id="section-cost-estimate">
      <h2>
        📄 Miles Makine Group, Web Sitesi Geliştirme Ve Tasarım Fiyat Teklifi
      </h2>
      <header style="margin:32px 0 64px;">
        <p><strong>Hazırlayan:</strong> Burak Kuyucaklı</p>
        <p><strong>Tarih:</strong> 3 Temmuz 2025</p>
      </header>

      <div class="section">
        <h3>🔧 Proje Kapsamı ve Hizmetler</h3>
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Hizmet</th>
              <th>Açıklama</th>
              <th>Tahmini Süre</th>
              <th>Ücret (₺)</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr
              ><td>Proje Kurulumu</td><td
                >Altyapının hazırlanması, yapı planlaması, araçların
                entegrasyonu</td
              ><td>2 iş günü</td><td>2.000</td></tr
            >
            <tr
              ><td>Tasarım ve Görsel Dil</td><td
                >Marka kimliğine uygun özel arayüz tasarımı</td
              ><td>5 iş günü</td><td>8.000</td></tr
            >
            <tr
              ><td>Sayfa Tasarımı ve Uygulaması</td><td
                >4–5 ana sayfanın tasarımı ve kodlanması</td
              ><td>7 - 10 iş günü</td><td>10.000</td></tr
            >
            <tr
              ><td>Mobil ve Cihaz Uyumluluğu</td><td
                >Responsive tasarım, tüm cihazlarla uyum</td
              ><td>Dahil</td><td>Dahil</td></tr
            >
            <tr
              ><td>Etkileşimli Öğeler</td><td
                >Formlar, temel animasyonlar veya özel bileşenler</td
              ><td>1–2 gün</td><td>2.000</td></tr
            >
            <tr
              ><td>Performans Optimizasyonu</td><td
                >Hız, erişilebilirlik ve medya optimizasyonu</td
              ><td>2 gün</td><td>2.000</td></tr
            >
            <tr>
              <td>Çoklu Dil Desteği</td>
              <td>Tr, En, De</td>
              <td></td>
              <td>3.000</td>
            </tr>
            <tr
              ><td>Temel SEO Kurulumu</td><td
                >Meta etiketler, içerik yapısı, görsel alt metinler</td
              ><td>1 gün</td><td>1.000</td></tr
            >
            <tr
              ><td>Eğitim ve Teslimat</td><td
                >Kullanıcıya özel rehberlik ve kısa eğitim</td
              ><td>Dahil</td><td>Dahil</td></tr
            >
            <tr>
              <td colspan="3" style="text-align:right;">Tek proje:</td>
              <td><strong>28bin₺</strong></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <p style="text-align:right">
        Toplam Proje Ücreti: <strong
          >2 web sitesi için 2 * 28bin₺ = 56bin₺ TL</strong
        >
      </p>

      <div class="section" style="margin-top:64px;">
        <h3>💡 Notlar</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Tahmini proje süresi: 25–30 iş günü</li>
          <li>Ödeme planı: %50 başlangıçta, %50 teslimatta</li>
          <li>
            Orijinal stock görsel ve video ücretleri dahil değildir. Hosting,
            domain ve lisans ücretleri dahil değildir (talep edilirse
            sağlanabilir)
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </article>
  <style>
    .color-variant-01 {
      color: #eedf8e;
    }
    .letter-spc-variant-01 {
      letter-spacing: 4px;
    }
    .small {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
    }
    h2 {
      margin: 24px 0;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }

    h2 + h3 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      margin: 16px 0 48px 0;
    }

    a {
      color: #00bdbd !important;
    }

    ul {
      padding-bottom: 256px !important;
    }

    li {
      margin: 56px;
    }

    p {
      margin: 24px 0;
    }

    strong {
      border-bottom: 2px solid rgb(238, 211, 211);
    }

    table,
    aside {
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    tr > td {
      padding: 24px 0;
    }

    th {
      background-color: #d6bf3b;
      color: black;
    }

    article {
      margin: 0 auto;
      max-width: 768px;
      padding: 24px;
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
